<title>NORWAY: Statoil plans big seismic action.</title>
<headline>Statoil plans big seismic action.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Den norske stats oljeselskap AS (Statoil) said on Thursday its seismic activity this year would be the group's biggest.</p>
<p>The company's Status Weekly newsletter said activity included 4,000 square km of three-dimensional survey off Norway and Britain, and another 2,000 square km outside Nigeria.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
